  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b7f248180c489fa499210832cd18b602, type: 3}
  m_Name: Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroDialogueData
  lines:
  - In the ancient Skylands, the Astral Foxes lived among the drifting isles, guardians
    of the starlight above the world.
  - 'For generations, young foxes have gathered fallen stars, a sacred rite that
    guides them toward adulthood. '
  - Only when their light shines bright enough may they reunite with their parents
    and ancestors in a timeless tradition.
  - "The stars grant wishes to the world below, carrying hope through the endless
    sky\u2026 and today, a new journey begins."
  - For the smallest of the Astral Foxes now takes their first step into the clouds,
    chasing the starlight of destiny.
